        },
        {
          "text": "Kiyakiya nai Gideon ŋituŋa lowaetin daadaŋ a akwap a ŋina a ŋikamukumukui a ŋina a Epuraim tema, “Totiyaunos etijikis Ŋimidian. Ekamasi neni eya ŋakipi daadaŋ ka akitodol tari Bes-Bara ka Yorodan daŋ.” Aŋun, aponi tonyaraunae ŋikilyok ŋulu a ekabila a Epuraim daadaŋ, kikamasi ikes neni aya ŋakipi aŋolol daadaŋ akitodol Bes-Bara ka Yorodan daŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
