            "sid": "JDG 7:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apaki ŋina ewuapitotor Ŋisirael Ŋimidian, apotu kikamut ŋikarikok a ŋajorei a Ŋimidian ŋuluarei, Oreb ka Seeb, toara Oreb anataaba a ŋina a Oreb ka Seeb anacuet a epiini a ŋina a Seeb. Apotu Ŋisirael, yaut akou a Oreb ka ŋina Seeb neni a Gideon a ŋolo edoŋit ekekwaye Yorodan.",
          "type": "text",
